<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CEN BANK O/N REPO FAILS TO ATTRACT ANY BIDS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CEN BANK O/N REPO FAILS TO ATTRACT ANY BIDS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said its overnight repo tender to add liquidity failed to attract any bids.</p>
<p>The central bank set its minimum rate at 17.9 percent. The average overnight Prague interbank offered rate was 17.23 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
